---
description: VibeRaven Studio and Production Proof Pack context
alwaysApply: true
---

Default command: `npx -y viberaven`.

Use Studio-visible provider context, MCP status, CLI-agent connection status, access mode, release/version selections, and diff context before production-sensitive edits.

Use the Production Proof Pack before claiming launch readiness: prove RLS, webhooks, env vars, auth callbacks, monitoring signal, release risk, and provider-human actions.

Before editing production-sensitive files, read `.viberaven/agent-context.md` and `.viberaven/mission-map.md`.

Full production rules: `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` (installed by `npx -y viberaven init --agents all`).
